* Alternative: current-bleeding Gilbert cell. PMOS sources mirrored from iref inject about 140 uA into each
* RF-pair drain, so the quad and the loads carry less current; 3.6 kohm loads, a smaller quad, no output capacitor.
.subckt gilbert_mixer vss iref vdd lop lon rfp rfn ifoutp ifoutn
XREF iref iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=20 nf=4
CBIAS iref vss 1p
XTAILP stp iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=140 nf=28
XTAILN stn iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=140 nf=28
XNB pb iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=8 nf=2
XPB pb pb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=4 nf=1
XBLP drfp pb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=28 nf=4
XBLN drfn pb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=28 nf=4
CPB pb vdd 1p
XRFP drfp rfp stp vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.3 w=40 nf=8
XRFN drfn rfn stn vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.3 w=40 nf=8
RDEG stp sdeg 550
CDEG sdeg stn 4p
XQ1 ifoutp lop drfp vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=28 nf=7
XQ2 ifoutn lon drfp vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=28 nf=7
XQ3 ifoutn lop drfn vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=28 nf=7
XQ4 ifoutp lon drfn vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=28 nf=7
RLP vdd ifoutp 3.6k
RLN vdd ifoutn 3.6k
.ends gilbert_mixer
